# Byte-exact test data: fixtures are Power BI Desktop's own output (CRLF, no trailing newline)
# and golden files are what Blueprint must produce. Never let git convert their line endings
# (e.g. core.autocrlf on Windows), or the byte-for-byte tests fail on checkout.
fixtures/** -text
tests/golden/** -text
docs/probes/** -text
# Recorded MCP client sessions (packaging/windows/record_mcp_sessions.py): the SDK's own bytes,
# replayed into bp.exe by the Windows gate.
packaging/windows/*.jsonl -text
